        {
          "description": "List the verified customer&#39;s own loans: loan id, type (HOME, AUTO, PERSONAL), principal, outstanding balance, interest rate, monthly payment, next due date and status. Read-only: the assistant never approves, changes or defers a loan (hardship requests go to open_service_case).",
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "get_my_loans",
            "handlerDescription": "List the verified customer's own loans: loan id, type (HOME, AUTO, PERSONAL), principal, outstanding balance, interest rate, monthly payment, next due date and status. Read-only: the assistant never approves, changes or defers a loan (hardship requests go to open_service_case).",
            "toolTitle": "",
